{"id": null, "n": "0414004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414004", "type": "orig", "text": "人下一有每月滲經水且六字產下時神下頂字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414005", "type": "orig", "text": "若作並"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414006", "type": "orig", "text": "將去二字在若穢之間"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414007", "type": "orig", "text": "溪河洗澤作洗溪河"}
{"id": null, "n": "0414008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0414008", "type": "orig", "text": "女下有不覺二字"}
